= 源码与参考资料索引

应用与 renderer 路径相对 companion 仓库；`icexiv-data:` 前缀的路径相对独立库仓库。应用在线链接指向 dev，独立库指向 main；本书从 `1286ba32d156` 整理并随抽离更新，查证时优先使用锁定版本的同名符号，不依赖固定行号。

== 资源与依赖

| 本地文件 | 优先查找的符号 |
| --- | --- |
| src/app/user_local_directory.rs | ensure_window_user_local_directory_handle、目录权限与布局 |
| src/app/browser_sqpack.rs | BrowserSqPack、find_entry_location、浏览器 slice / 权限接线 |
| src/app/resources.rs | AsyncGameResource impl、BrowserSqPackGameResource、各领域加载接线 |
| icexiv-data: src/storage/resource.rs | AsyncGameResource、MemoryResource、Resource |
| icexiv-data: src/storage/sqpack.rs | read_entry、sqpack_index_candidates_for_path |
| icexiv-data: src/assets/loaders.rs | ModelPathContext、load_*_from_async_resource |
| icexiv-data: src/formats/imc.rs | ImcFile、ImcEntry、subset_for_variant |
| icexiv-data: src/chara/models.rs | PackedCharaModelId、chara_model_candidate_paths |
| icexiv-data: src/catalog/furniture.rs | furniture_sgb_path、extract_sgb_asset_paths |

